  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Shaded area $=e-\\left(\\int_0^1 e^x d x\\right)=1$\nAlso, $\\quad \\int_1^e \\ln (e+1-y) d y$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/oZ4wxm1sBB6e6-hxsJA-BK35ZdmsmKWhMSod8yCCHEg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\int_e^q \\ln t(-d t) \\\\\n& \\text { [put } e+1-y=t \\Rightarrow-d y=d t \\text { ] } \\\\\n& =\\int_1^e \\ln t d t=\\int_1^e \\ln y d y=1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
